          <div class="enterprise-card">
            <div class="enterprise-icon"><AlarmClock /></div>
            <h3>Autopilot</h3>
            <p>Arbitrary 5-field cron with IANA time zones (DST-aware), or <code>@hourly</code>/<code>@daily</code>/<code>@weekly</code>/<code>@monthly</code>. Backed by JSON, SQLite, or Postgres; multiple scheduler replicas coordinate via atomic claim-locking. Full REST CRUD at <code>/api/autopilot/schedules</code>.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="enterprise-card">
            <div class="enterprise-icon"><GitPullRequest /></div>
            <h3>Pull requests &mdash; every provider</h3>
